214
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:53,500
Is that an Orc King?
No, there should only be one of those.

215
00:10:56,540 --> 00:11:00,130
So, my first real look at magic in this world
is thanks to a monster?

216
00:11:00,460 --> 00:11:02,130
Funny, since I can't cast any myself.

217
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:04,290
Pro gamer mode on, baby.

218
00:11:06,710 --> 00:11:07,380
Brace for a second wave!

219
00:11:08,330 --> 00:11:09,170
Man, that's hot!

220
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:14,130
Damn. They hit my forces in the rear
where Bron can't cover.

221
00:11:14,580 --> 00:11:15,880
You're gonna pay for that!

222
00:11:16,210 --> 00:11:17,210
Eat lead, sucker!

223
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:21,330
Hell yeah! I can OHKO these fools!

224
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:23,170
I have two steel balls left.

225
00:11:23,170 --> 00:11:24,830
I just need to not miss...

226
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:27,210
Uh, where'd they go?

227
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:34,080
Dammit! They moved out of my range!

228
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:38,040
These damn swine are smart!
They even know to aim for me.

229
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:51,210
This is a scene straight outta Hell.
They've still got a hundred troops or so.

230
00:11:52,210 --> 00:11:54,710
I better quit playing defense
and make this a war of attrition.

231
00:11:55,040 --> 00:11:57,000
I've got plenty of D-rank magic stones.

232
00:11:57,330 --> 00:11:59,960
I can summon more than 20,000 copies
of Teddy, if needed.

233
00:12:00,380 --> 00:12:02,290
Plus, I've got 100 MP recovery items stocked up.

234
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,790
I'll just keep going until my MP runs dry.

235
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:06,500
Sic 'em, Teddy!

236
00:12:13,500 --> 00:12:15,880
Great. The tide is slowly turning in my favor.

237
00:12:21,830 --> 00:12:23,290
Cue boss battle music.

238
00:12:24,130 --> 00:12:25,420
The Orc King is here!

239
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:34,540
Did he just mow my guys down in one hit?
B-ranks are freakin' strong!

240
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,250
Create, Enhance, and Summon!

241
00:12:40,380 --> 00:12:42,040
Create, Enhance, and Summon!

242
00:12:43,830 --> 00:12:45,460
Create, Enhance, and Summon!

243
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:49,040
